00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:38.630
Gosh, what do you mean, "Good morning"?

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:42.870
Have some consideration for the person who spends fifteen minutes waking you up every morning!

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:45.340
Oh, I'm getting up! I'm getting up, so please move!

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:48.720
You just plan on going back to sleep, don't you?!

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.810
It's okay. I'll really get up!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.470
I don't think I can trust you.

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:54.230
<i>Why are you freaking out, Onii-chan?</i>

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.650
<i>Just calm down and explain yourself!</i>

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:03.910
Good morning!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.150
Y-You're late.

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:08.200
Good morning, Nao-chin.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:12.790
What's with you two? You're acting kinda weird.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.020
R-Really?

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:15.920
Y-Yeah, it's just your imagination.

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:18.130
Is that it? I'm imagining things, then?

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.360
So she's just going to ignore what happened last Saturday.

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:21.510
Good morning!

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:24.790
Haru-chan, Hiro-rin, good morning!

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:26.360
Iroha-chan, good morning!

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:29.430
Ah, Nao-chan, good morning!

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:31.730
Iroha-chan, you bought a new bag!

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.860
Yeah, I picked it up last Saturday.

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.430
I wanted it the moment I saw it.

00:19:35.430 --> 00:19:36.520
That's great. It's so cute!

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:39.750
S-Someone stop this!

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:45.030
Tsuchiura, who calmly brought the bag she bought during her date with Nao's brother, is scary.

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:50.290
But Nao, who knows about everything, but doesn't say a thing, is also scary!

00:19:57.950 --> 00:20:00.300
Captain, I was mistaken.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:04.300
Please let me rejoin the A.G.E. exploration team!

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:05.950
I beg of you!

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:11.780
Aren't you being a little too selfish, Shuusuke?

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:15.250
"Girls will only treat you like perverts if you watch porn DVDs."

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:17.630
"You're going to stay a virgin if you keep watching porn DVDs."

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:21.780
"The only thing you'll get from watching porn DVDs are more friends that reek of semen."

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:25.510
You were the one who said those things, Shuusuke.

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:27.450
I was mistaken!

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:31.390
Porn DVDs will pave the road to losing our virginity!

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:35.980
Women who hate men just for watching porn DVDs won't let you do them, anyway.

00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:38.810
Sharing porn DVDs with your friends...

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:41.540
...is the only way to discover a new self!

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:43.630
K-Kishikawa!

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:46.050
You got dumped, right?

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:52.170
However, the words of a traitor cannot be trusted!

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:55.190
Prove to me your unwavering resolve!

00:20:57.840 --> 00:20:58.480
This is...?

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:01.230
A bonus that came with the porno I bought last night.

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:03.490
It was worth 1500 yen!

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:10.330
D-Did you say 1500 yen?

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:12.120
Such a luxurious thing...

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:19.170
I always knew you'd come back.

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:21.920
E-Everyone!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:25.570
Wipe your tears, Shuusuke.

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:30.440
Now, let's go find a leaked idol video, where you can't tell...

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:33.010
...who the actual person is because of the poor image quality.

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:34.270
Thank you, everyone!

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:38.040
Okay, you bastards! Tomorrow we're hitting the back streets of Akiba!

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:40.060
Yeah!

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:15.120
Big brother's turn-ons observation diary.

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:18.980
I <i>just happened</i> to chance upon a secret
meeting between Iroha-chan and my brother.

00:23:18.980 --> 00:23:21.830
I have discovered that the two are actually more than friends.

00:23:23.050 --> 00:23:25.650
For romance to blossom between my brother and me,

00:23:25.650 --> 00:23:29.340
we need to face obstacles like this, so it's okay.
